A capability to a new thread carries a notification's code below its address and above its first child's link.
Anything that reads the words whole, a move's check or a description, sees another capability;
only a Notification capability carries bits besides its object.

Caught-by: fuzz fuzz-pmp8 fuzz-rp2350 fuzz-smp2 fuzz-work qemu-replay
Report: a node carries bits its type has no use for
Witness: fuzz actor-handoff

diff --git a/kernel/cap.c b/kernel/cap.c
--- a/kernel/cap.c
+++ b/kernel/cap.c
@@ -319,7 +319,7 @@ int cap_clear(struct captable *table, uint32_t slot)
 struct cap cap_to_object(struct obj_header *obj, uint8_t rights)
 {
     struct cap c = { .type = obj->type, .rights = rights, .a = v2p(obj) };
-    if (obj->type == CAP_NOTIFICATION) {
+    if (obj->type == CAP_NOTIFICATION || obj->type == CAP_THREAD) {
         notify_set(&c, v2p(obj), NOTIFY_CODE_ALL);
     }
     return c;
